                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is astonishing in every negative sense of the word you could possibly infer. Maybe my favourite unique feature on show here is that every time you die, that frame rate drops just a little bit more to the point where if you die enough, it just looks like you're browsing a slideshow gallery of a late 90's game from development hell.\nSeriously though, some of the most bewildering garbage I have ever spent half an hour with.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SHzQuptjQaw",
